WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:03.831
A fact might be: "There is already a website form," if

00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:05.248
someone has inspected it.

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:09.648
An assumption might be: "The form stores every message,"

00:00:09.857 --> 00:00:11.018
if no one has checked.

00:00:11.529 --> 00:00:15.105
An unknown might be: "Can an inquiry be submitted without

00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:18.692
an email address?" This distinction is not a test of your

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.237
memory.

00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:23.057
It is a way to make uncertainty visible so the team can

00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:24.694
research the right things.

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:29.141
Contradictions deserve attention too: asking for automatic

00:00:29.199 --> 00:00:32.554
outreach and also saying no messages should leave without

00:00:32.577 --> 00:00:34.504
approval needs clarification.
